  "scope": "Static review of runtime frontend TSX sources and the drawing-tool glyph registry. SVG counts are declaration/use sites, including non-icon graphics, not unique UI icon totals. Literal text-action detection is a candidate list, not a complete Unicode inventory.",
  "base_sha": "51732d1b0182cc00077967e16e0c30934874c635",
  "findings": [
    {
      "area": "Candle toolbar",
      "priority": "first",
      "sources": [
        "frontend/src/live/LiveToolbar.tsx:37",
        "frontend/src/chart/ChartCaptureActions.tsx:75",
        "frontend/src/live/EyeGlyph.tsx:20",
        "frontend/src/live/workspace/ChartWindow.tsx:903",
        "frontend/src/live/workspace/CursorLinkAction.tsx:11",
        "frontend/src/studyViews/LiveStudyViewSaveButton.tsx:94"
      ],
      "observed": "Plus/jump/collect use 12px and 2.5 stroke; capture uses 14px and 1.8; eye uses 14px and 1.6 with a 1.8 hidden slash. Seconds inspection, cursor link and saved view use font glyphs. IconToolbarButton has no shared glyph sizing contract.",
      "recommendation": "Shared 14px/1.6/round action glyphs; preserve current tooltips, disabled guards and wrapping/folding behavior."
    },
    {
      "area": "Drawing tools",
      "priority": "first",
      "sources": [
        "frontend/src/chart/drawing/tools.ts:407",
        "frontend/src/live/DrawingMenu.tsx:122",
        "frontend/src/live/DrawingMenu.tsx:211"
      ],
      "observed": "Tool registry carries character glyphs such as select arrow, thick line, rect, measurement arrow, pencil and eraser; trigger and menu render them as text.",
      "recommendation": "Keep the pure interaction registry and DrawingTool identity; render SVG glyphs from a UI-side mapping keyed by tool. Preserve active-tool shape changes, labels, shortcuts and drawing geometry."
    },
    {
      "area": "Right navigation rail",
      "priority": "second",
      "sources": [
        "frontend/src/rightrail/RightRail.tsx:50",
        "frontend/src/ui/HeatmapIcon.tsx:15",
        "frontend/src/ui/BookmarkIcon.tsx:9",
        "frontend/src/ui/SettingsIcon.tsx:2",
        "frontend/src/ui/RailShell.tsx:174"
      ],
      "observed": "Icons mix 1.8 and 2 strokes. The 1.125em sizing inherits 13px body text at default settings (~14.625px), not an explicit 18px navigation size. General settings and refined window settings use different gear geometry.",
      "recommendation": "Use a deliberate 18px (1.125rem) navigation role with 1.6/round strokes, retaining 48px rail, visible labels, current selected bar/tint and meaningful filled states."
    },
    {
      "area": "Panel/menu actions",
      "priority": "second",
      "sources": [
        "frontend/src/ui/RailActionIcons.tsx:3",
        "frontend/src/ui/SortDirectionIcon.tsx:32",
        "frontend/src/ui/ChevronIcon.tsx:18",
        "frontend/src/ui/RailShell.tsx:106",
        "frontend/src/live/workspace/windowKindIcons.tsx:25"
      ],
      "observed": "Action geometry uses 1em/12/13/14/16px and strokes 1.8/1.9/2. Some controls use persistent borders while neighboring actions are ghost buttons.",
      "recommendation": "Panel headers use 16px glyphs in their existing 28px targets; compact row/menu controls use 14px. Share line/hover/focus rules without flattening selection state or changing narrow-layout budgets."
    },
    {
      "area": "Modal/toast/indicator controls",
      "priority": "third",
      "sources": [
        "frontend/src/ui/ModalShell.tsx:117",
        "frontend/src/ui/toast/ToastCard.tsx:46",
        "frontend/src/capture/CaptureQueueRow.tsx:131",
        "frontend/src/live/indicators/IndicatorPanelMenu.tsx:129"
      ],
      "observed": "Close/retry/more controls still mix text glyphs (x variants, rotating arrow and ellipsis) with existing SVG components.",
      "recommendation": "Consolidate close, refresh and more SVG primitives. Keep accessible names, undo/dismiss meanings, loading animation and focus return."
    }
  ],
